    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n21940" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">implăcĭdus</span></b>  (<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">inpl-</span></b> ), a, um,
